#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/wiggle.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.wiggle.wiggle:47
msgid ""
"Position of the vertical scale on the plot. It can be specified in multiple "
"ways:  - A :class:`pygmt.params.Position` object to fully control the "
"reference point,   anchor point, and offset. - A sequence of two values "
"representing the x- and y-coordinates in plot   coordinates, e.g., ``(1, "
"2)`` or ``(\"1c\", \"2c\")``. - A :doc:`2-character justification code </"
"techref/justification_codes>` for a   position inside the plot, e.g., "
"``\"TL\"`` for Top Left corner inside the plot.  If not specified, defaults "
"to the Bottom Left corner of the plot with a 0.2-cm offset."
