"uint64_t (8-byte unsigned int) - **f**: 4-byte single-precision float - "
"**d**: 8-byte double-precision float - **x**: use to skip *ncols* anywhere "
"in the record  For records with mixed types, append additional comma-"
"separated combinations of *ncols* *type* (no space). The following modifiers "
"are supported:  - **w** after any item to force byte-swapping. - **+l**\\|\\ "
"**b** to indicate that the entire data file should be   read as little- or "
"big-endian, respectively.  Full documentation is at :gmt-docs:`gmt.html#bi-"
