"**c**\\ *period*\\ [/*phase*][**+c**\\ *col*]. Convert the input *x*-"
"coordinate to a cyclical coordinate, or a different column if selected via "
"**+c**\\ *col*. The following cyclical coordinate transformations are "
"supported:"
msgstr ""

